# Language conventions

| What | Language |
| ---- | -------- |
| Commit messages, branch names, tags | English |
| Pull request titles and descriptions, review comments | English |
| Code, identifiers, file names, code comments, technical logs | English |
| Documentation: `docs/`, `README.md`, `CONTRIBUTING.md`, ADRs, specs and plans | Ukrainian |
| UI text and user-facing error messages | Ukrainian |

Commit messages follow Conventional Commits; the changelog is generated from them, so it is English too.

```text
# BAD
docs: додано дизайн флоу розробки

# GOOD
docs: add development flow and documentation design
```
